{"id":"counter-permits","title":"Approved at the counter","question":"How many building permits are issued the day they are filed, and how much construction goes through that way?","finding":"In 2019 the Department of Building Inspection issued 37,290 building permits, 22,921 of them (61%) on the day they were filed; in 2025, 12,408 of 22,872 (54%). By declared construction value the same-day share is far smaller: $287.2 million of $4.19 billion in 2019 (6.8%) and $304.0 million of $2.73 billion in 2025 (11%). From 2019 to 2025 same-day permits carried $1.81 billion of $20.70 billion in declared value. Almost none of the permits sent for plan review (1 of 981 in 2025) or for new buildings (0 of 45) were issued the same day. How long the rest take, and who gets through fastest, is in the site’s “How the permit process works” page.","how":"One record per permit in the Building Permits table (the row marked as the primary address), grouped by the year of issue. “Same day” means the issued date equals the filed date. Value is the revised cost where one is recorded, otherwise the applicant’s estimated cost. The four kinds follow the permit form: over-the-counter alterations (form 8), alterations sent for plan review (form 3), new buildings (forms 1 and 2), and signs, demolitions and other work.","limits":"A same-day permit is not an unreviewed permit: the Controller’s 2021 review of the department describes over-the-counter permits as “smaller, less complicated projects” whose applications plan reviewers check against the building code, and the permit table records when completed work was signed off by inspection staff. Construction value is declared by the applicant and is sometimes entered as $1. From February 2026 new applications moved to a new permit system that this table does not hold, so 2026 is not comparable. No applicant or address is listed. What this cannot show: whether the plans at the counter matched what was built; the inspection record, which the City does not publish as data, would.","tier":"REDFLAG","columns":[{"k":"year","t":"Year issued","type":"year"},{"k":"kind","t":"Kind of permit","type":"text"},{"k":"issued","t":"Permits issued","type":"int"},{"k":"sameDay","t":"Issued the day filed","type":"int"},{"k":"sameDayShare","t":"Share","type":"pct"},{"k":"value","t":"Declared construction value","type":"usd"},{"k":"sameDayValue","t":"Value on same-day permits","type":"usd"},{"k":"sameDayValueShare","t":"Share of value","type":"pct"}],"rows":[{"year":"2019","kind":"Alterations issued over the counter (form 8)","issued":34486,"sameDay":22811,"sameDayShare":0.6615,"value":1914188850,"sameDayValue":286709992,"sameDayValueShare":0.1498},{"year":"2019","kind":"Alterations sent for plan review (form 3)","issued":2086,"sameDay":1,"sameDayShare":0.0005,"value":878677965,"sameDayValue":40000,"sameDayValueShare":0.0},{"year":"2019","kind":"New buildings","issued":92,"sameDay":0,"sameDayShare":0.0,"value":1376733612,"sameDayValue":0,"sameDayValueShare":0.0},{"year":"2019","kind":"Signs, demolitions and other","issued":626,"sameDay":109,"sameDayShare":0.1741,"value":24316328,"sameDayValue":459640,"sameDayValueShare":0.0189},{"year":"2020","kind":"Alterations issued over the counter (form 8)","issued":18042,"sameDay":8206,"sameDayShare":0.4548,"value":869974371,"sameDayValue":142854493,"sameDayValueShare":0.1642},{"year":"2020","kind":"Alterations sent for plan review (form 3)","issued":1224,"sameDay":0,"sameDayShare":0.0,"value":661412465,"sameDayValue":0,"sameDayValueShare":0.0},{"year":"2020","kind":"New buildings","issued":69,"sameDay":0,"sameDayShare":0.0,"value":1255382575,"sameDayValue":0,"sameDayValueShare":0.0},{"year":"2020","kind":"Signs, demolitions and other","issued":353,"sameDay":16,"sameDayShare":0.0453,"value":9289094,"sameDayValue":113755,"sameDayValueShare":0.0122},{"year":"2021","kind":"Alterations issued over the counter (form 8)","issued":20529,"sameDay":10195,"sameDayShare":0.4966,"value":1140423229,"sa